WEBVTT

1
00:00:00,460 --> 00:00:02,260
Brother Changsheng, have a happy New Year.

2
00:00:05,020 --> 00:00:08,820
Changsheng. This year, Shantun can enjoy this New Year’s Eve dinner in a down-to-earth manner.

3
00:00:08,820 --> 00:00:11,220
Thanks to you for removing the poison from Lao Longkou

4
00:00:11,750 --> 00:00:13,950
They are all from the same village. It is wrong to say this.

5
00:00:13,950 --> 00:00:15,150
Brother, I took the money back

6
00:00:15,150 --> 00:00:17,950
My mother happily said that I would set up a longevity tablet for you in the morning.

7
00:00:17,950 --> 00:00:20,150
I lived a good life, what kind of memorial tablet should I erect?

8
00:00:20,150 --> 00:00:26,080
A meal with meat

9
00:00:26,280 --> 00:00:27,900
Shattered peace

10
00:00:33,320 --> 00:00:36,140
Isn't this person dead?
